---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Legionella Risk Assessments in Edinburgh | Scottish Energy Services"
  description="Book a Legionella risk assessment in Edinburgh with Scottish Energy Services. Suitable for landlords, residential lets, and managed properties."
  canonicalPath="/legionella-risk-assessment-edinburgh"
>
  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="container-pro max-w-4xl space-y-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">Legionella risk assessments in Edinburgh</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-700">
        Scottish Energy Services supports Edinburgh landlords and agents who need practical Legionella risk assessments as part of
        responsible property management.
      </p>
      <div class="quote-card space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Who this is useful for</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-slate-700 space-y-1">
          <li>Landlords reviewing risk controls for rental homes.</li>
          <li>Managers onboarding newly acquired or recently vacated properties.</li>
          <li>Owners who want an up-to-date risk snapshot of their domestic water systems.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-700">
        Request your appointment from the <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/#quote">online quote page</a> and include the
        postcode for accurate pricing.
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-700">
        If you also require an EPC, visit <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/epc-edinburgh">EPC assessments in Edinburgh</a>
        or return to the <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/">main homepage</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
